# Copy this file to `credentials.env` (git-ignored) and fill in your own key.
# Bring-your-own-key: the app uses YOUR LLM key and runs locally (CLAUDE.md §5).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional: override the model used for tailoring/intake.
# RESUME_AGENT_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# Optional: Adzuna job aggregator (widens sourcing across ~20 countries). Free dev keys
# from https://developer.adzuna.com/ . Left blank, the Adzuna feed simply no-ops.
# ADZUNA_APP_ID=your_app_id
# ADZUNA_APP_KEY=your_app_key
# ADZUNA_COUNTRY=us

# --- Email / inbox (optional; CLAUDE.md §5) ---------------------------------
# To let SponsorJobs read YOUR mailbox for application verifications and recruiter
# replies, use Gmail's official API — no key goes here. Create an OAuth
# "Desktop app" client in Google Cloud, download it, and save it as:
#   config/gmail_credentials.json   (git-ignored)
# On first scan you'll authorize once; the token caches to:
#   config/gmail_token.json         (git-ignored)
# Scope requested is READ-ONLY (gmail.readonly) — SponsorJobs reads job-related mail,
# drafts replies for you to review, and never sends or modifies anything.

# --- Telegram approve-while-away (optional; CLAUDE.md §5) --------------------
# Get an alert when a tailored package is ready and approve it from your phone
# with a one-line reply. Create a bot with @BotFather for the token, then send
# your bot a message and read your chat id (e.g. from @userinfobot). The bot
# obeys ONLY this chat, and approving marks a package applied — it never submits.
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456:ABC-your-bot-token
# TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=123456789
